    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>join the edges of, push together (benefactive plural of cìŋàá)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 11 occurrences, first EXO.26.9; Childs 2000, p. 47: cììŋìàlló</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Pluriel (verbal) de ciŋaa.</text></form></note>
