      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.2.3 Types of food"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>be red (yellow), be ripe; also temper iron, be drunk</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 2 occurrences, first AMO.8.1; Childs 2000, p. 85: dìùwɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>yɔmii koamɛi diuvɛi « des fruits mûrs » (AMO.8.1-2).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
