      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.5 Animal home"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 120: héèyó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="hèèŋúúwó_1024">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>hèèŋúúwó</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <sense id="hèèŋúúwó_1024_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>carapace, coquille (d'escargot)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>carapace, shell (e.g. of a snail)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.2 Parts of an animal"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 119: hèèŋúúwó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="helnɔnndo_1025">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>helnɔnndo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>helnɔn</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="helnɔnndo_1025_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>monter, s'élever (au ciel)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>go up, ascend, rise (into the sky)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.2.2 Move in a direction"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>climb, ascend</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 3 occurrences, first JDG.13.20; Childs 2000, p. 120: hèlnɔ̀ŋndó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Moyen de helɔɔ « monter ». mɛlɛkanɔ Hala-o helnɔnndo coocoo o yelenyelen kon nin « l'ange de Dieu montait dans la flamme » (JDG.13.20) ; sunsun i co helnɔn « maintenant je m'élève » (ISA.33.10).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="hèlùlló_1026">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>hèlùlló</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <sense id="hèlùlló_1026_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>gagner, prendre (qqch) à qqn (dans une dispute)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>win (something) from someone (in a contest)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.8 Conflict"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.4.3 Get"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 120: hèlùlló</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Bénéfactif de hìɔ̀lɔ̀ɔ́ (hiɔlɔɔ dans le lexique).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="helɔɔ_1027">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>helɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>hel</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>helnin</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="helɔɔ_1027_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>monter ; hauteur</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>go up, climb; height</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.2.2 Move in a direction"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.2.2 Long"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>climb, go up, rise; also mount, breed (animals)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 135 occurrences, first GEN.6.16; Childs 2000, p. 120: hèlɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="hemndo_1028">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>hemndo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>hemndan</text></form></field>
    <sense id="hemndo_1028_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>gourde, outre</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>gourd, skin bottle</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.7.7 Container"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.5.5 Parts of a plant"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>gourd for keeping oil or wine</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 5 occurrences, first JDG.6.19; Keita 1979, p. 139: Hemndo; Childs 2000, p. 120: hěmndó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Dans la Bible, mɔiyan hemndo « une outre de vin ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="hendullo_1029">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>hendullo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>hendul</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>hendulun</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="hendullo_1029_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>donner (un ordre) à ; tendre (un piège) à</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>give (an order) to; set (a snare) for</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.1 Say"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.4.2 Trap"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>put or place something for someone</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 8 occurrences, first 1SA.28.9; Childs 2000, p. 120: hèndùlló</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Bénéfactif de handɔɔ « mettre ». hendul … tɔŋndo « ordonner » ; yaŋɔɔlen hendullo « tendre un piège ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="héú_1030">
