    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="iɲíí_1179_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>pitié, miséricorde ; (tuinun … iɲíí) avoir pitié de</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>pity, mercy; (tuinun … iɲíí) have mercy on</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.3.4 Do good to"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>sorrow, pity, mercy</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 162 occurrences, first GEN.30.27; Childs 2000, p. 277: ɲèéyé</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="ka_1180">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>ka</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="check"/>
    <sense id="ka_1180_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Particle"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>(après un indéfini redoublé) quel qu'il soit, de toutes sortes</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>(after a reduplicated indefinite) whatever, of every kind</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.2.6 Particles"/>
    </sense>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>súú-súù ka « de toutes sortes » ; nɛɛ-nɛɛ ka « partout » ; ɲɛ-ɲɛ ka co ya o ba « j'ai de tout » (Gn 33,11).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="ká_1181">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>ká</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <sense id="ká_1181_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Adverb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>longtemps, loin, beaucoup</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>for a long time, far, a lot</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.1 Quantity"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.4.2 Take time"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 139: ká</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Peut-être apparenté à la particule ka de la Bible (súú-súù ka).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kàá_1182">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kàá</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>kàà</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="kàá_1182_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>renard, chacal</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>fox, jackal</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.1 Types of animals"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>small dog-like forest animal, a kind of wolf</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 35 occurrences, first LEV.18.3; Childs 2000, p. 140: kàá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="káà_1183">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>káà</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>káàlan</text></form></field>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>kaala</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="káà_1183_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>manière d'agir, conduite ; défaut</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>way of acting, conduct; fault</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.3 Behavior"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 35 occurrences, first LEV.18.3; Childs 2000, p. 140: káá</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>La vial … a káà « n'imitez pas leur conduite » ; káà vɔɔndo « quelque chose de honteux » (Dt 24,1).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kaa_1184">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kaa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="kaa_1184_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>toit, plafond</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>roof, ceiling</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.5.2 Parts of a building"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>attic, area above the mats forming the ceiling</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 35 occurrences, first LEV.18.3; Childs 2000, p. 140: kàá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kàá_1185">
