      <gloss lang="en"><text>rice flour with tiny hard grains (made from dɛ̀mdɛ̀mndó)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.2.3 Types of food"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 156: kèŋgèmùkíó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
