      <gloss lang="fr"><text>piquer, mordre (insecte)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>sting, bite (insect)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.4 Animal actions"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>bite, sting, pinch; also throb (of a sore)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 1 occurrences, first EXO.8.14; Childs 2000, p. 171: kìsìó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Mí muiya va vanndacieea a visia kisio « les moustiques piquaient hommes et bêtes » (EXO.8.14). Une seule occurrence.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
