    <sense id="landìlandìo_1991_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>écume, bave (à la bouche) ; (vanalanɔ landilandio) femme querelleuse</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>foam, froth (at the mouth); (vanalanɔ landilandio) quarrelsome woman</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.2.3 Spit, saliva"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 4 occurrences, first PRO.21.19; Childs 2000, p. 223: làndìlàndìóó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>landìlandìo fula ndu o sondo « il écume » (MRK.9.20).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="landɔɔ_1992">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>landɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>landu</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>landun</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>landunin</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="landɔɔ_1992_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>suspendre, pendre ; (hɔlla landɔɔ … coo) veiller sur, avoir la charge de</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>hang, suspend; (hɔlla landɔɔ … coo) watch over, be in charge of</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.3.2 Move something in a direction"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.5 Authority"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 35 occurrences, first GEN.30.31; Childs 2000, p. 223: làndɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>o co nɔm landɔɔ o yɔm bɛndoo « il te pendra à un arbre » (GEN.40.19) ; hɔlla landɔɔ o Calta Mɛlɛka coo « avoir la charge du Tabernacle » (NUM.3.25).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="langa_1993">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>langa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="check"/>
    <sense id="langa_1993_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Adverb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>tout juste, déjà, il y a peu</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>just, already, a moment ago</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.4.5 Relative time"/>
    </sense>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>ndu bɛɛ langa tiiya ciee sunsun « il vient d'arriver en ville » (1 S 9,12).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="langbanɔɔ_1994">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>langbanɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
