      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>coupe-coupe, machette</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>machete, cutlass</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.7.1 Cutting tool"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 2 occurrences, first ISA.10.34; Keita 1979, p. 159: Lèèndo; Childs 2000, p. 228: lɛ́ɛ́ŋndó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="lɛɛnduu_2174">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>lɛɛnduu</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="lɛɛnduu_2174_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>suspendre, accrocher, fixer (plusieurs choses) ; pendre (plusieurs personnes)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>hang up, attach, fasten (several things); hang (several people)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.3.2 Move something in a direction"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.5.2 Join, attach"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>hang many things (plural of làndɔ̀ɔ́)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 19 occurrences, first EXO.25.12; Childs 2000, p. 228: lɛ̀ɛ̀ndùùwó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>mó lɛɛnduu nda o yɔmnde ndii ŋuɛɛnu « il les pendit à cinq arbres » (JOS.10.26) ; n lɛɛnduu bangala naalan « nous suspendions nos harpes » (PSA.137.2). Pluriel verbal de landɔɔ. Cf. lɛnduuoo (2SA.1.24).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="lɛ́ɛ́siɛn_2175">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>lɛ́ɛ́siɛn</text></form></lexical-unit>
