  <entry id="malnun_2210">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>malnun</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>malnɔnndo</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>malnunnin</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>malnɔn</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="malnun_2210_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>abandonner, se dessaisir de ; remettre (une dette) ; (malnun kɔl) rendre l'âme</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>give up, let go of; remit (a debt); (malnun kɔl) breathe one's last</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.4.5 Keep something"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.6.6 Die"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>drop, leave or lose (by itself)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 63 occurrences, first GEN.49.33; Childs 2000, p. 240: màlnɔ̃ŋndó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Moyen de malɔɔ. mó malnun kɔl « il expira » (GEN.49.33) ; kueelan la bɛnda mì la malnun « vous remettrez les dettes » (DEU.15.1).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="maloo_2211">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>maloo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="maloo_2211_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>hippopotame</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>hippopotamus</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.1 Types of animals"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 136: Maloo; Childs 2000, p. 240: màlòó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Dans la Bible, maloo n'apparaît que dans l'adverbe homonyme maloo-maloo (PRO.7.11).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="maluaŋ_2212">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>maluaŋ</text></form></lexical-unit>
