    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>sow (grain)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 27 occurrences, first GEN.47.19; Keita 1979, p. 115: Sanhöö; Childs 2000, p. 322: sàŋɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>seŋ, seŋnin : radical négatif (MAT 6,26 ; LEV 25,20). saŋ « disperser » (EXO 9,8).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
