  <entry id="sooloo_3071">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sooloo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sooluu</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sooloo_3071_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>adorer, servir (un dieu), se prosterner devant</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>worship, serve (a god), bow down to</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.5 Practice religion"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>plural of 'talk'; worship (God, an idol)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 127 occurrences, first EXO.12.12; Childs 2000, p. 339: sòòlùùwɔ́</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sooluula_3072">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sooluula</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sooluulan</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sooluula_3072_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>lieux de culte (pl.), sanctuaires ; (o sooluulan) aux hauts lieux</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>places of worship (pl.), shrines; (o sooluulan) at the high places</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.8 Religious things"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>place of worship or praise</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 24 occurrences, first LEV.26.30; Childs 2000, p. 339: sòòlúúláŋ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>De sooloo « adorer ». mì tɛɛmbuu sooluula niaalan « je détruirai vos hauts lieux » (LEV.26.30) ; o sooluulan vannda va sálàlan solio ni « le peuple sacrifiait sur les hauts lieux » (1KI.3.2).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sóómàmɛ̀ŋndó_3073">
