  <entry id="sùnndo_3120">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sùnndo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sùnndo_3120_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>pilon ; meule (supérieure)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>pestle; (upper) millstone</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.7.2 Pounding tool"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.2.1 Food preparation"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>tree whose wood is used for pestles; pestle; its leaves</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 3 occurrences, first DEU.24.6; Childs 2000, p. 345: sùŋndó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>bii sùnndo a ciei o landei nin « prendre en gage la meule ou le mortier » (DEU.24.6) ; mɛɛ vana cu kullon a sunndo « comme on pile le grain au pilon » (PRO.27.22) ; diom lasunndo « le bruit de la meule » (JER.25.10).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
