    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 13 occurrences, first GEN.19.11; Childs 2000, p. 344: sùmìá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="suundaa_3134">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>suundaa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="suundaa_3134_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>adultère, prostitution, débauche</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>adultery, prostitution</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.6.2 Sexual relations"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.3 Behavior"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>to fornicate (verb)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 85 occurrences, first LEV.21.9; Keita 1979, p. 148: Suundaa; Childs 2000, p. 346: sùùndàá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="súúndùla_3135">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>súúndùla</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="súúndùla_3135_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>prépuces (pl.)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>foreskins (pl.)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.1.2 Torso"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.5 Practice religion"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>foreskin; also elephant shrew</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 3 occurrences, first 1SA.18.25; Childs 2000, p. 346: súùndóó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Pluriel ; le singulier n'est pas dans la Bible. Ɲɛ o yeema daama-o co súúndùla Filistia kɛmɛ « il ne demande que cent prépuces de Philistins » (1SA.18.25, 1SA.18.27, 2SA.3.14).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="suundɛiyo_3136">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>suundɛiyo</text></form></lexical-unit>
