    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 93 occurrences, first GEN.29.19; Keita 1979, p. 137: Söö; Childs 2000, p. 341: sɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɔ̀ɔ̀lǎŋndó_3176">
