  <entry id="sɛvala_3213">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛvala</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sɛvala_3213_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>écriture (système d'écriture)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>script, writing (system)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.7 Reading and writing"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>writings, publications (plural of 'write')</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 1 occurrences, first EST.3.12; Childs 2000, p. 329: sɛ̀wàláŋ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>De sɛvaa « écrire ». sɛbɛla lan la sɛwviaan o sɛvala yɛ́-yɛ́lan nin « les lettres furent écrites dans l'écriture de chaque province » (EST.3.12).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛvallo_3214">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛvallo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛval</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛvallo_3214_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>écrire pour, écrire à</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>write for, write to</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.7 Reading and writing"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 20 occurrences, first JDG.8.14; Keita 1979, p. 113: Sèvallo</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Bénéfactif de sɛvaa.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛvan_3215">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛvan</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sɛvan_3215_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>être écrit</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>be written</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.7 Reading and writing"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 128 occurrences, first EXO.28.10</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Moyen de sɛvaa « écrire ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛvanɔɔ_3216">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛvanɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="sɛvanɔɔ_3216_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>écrivain</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>writer</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.7 Reading and writing"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 145: Sèvanöö</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Cf. sɛva « écrire » dans la Bible.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛvɛi_3217">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛvɛi</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="i"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sɛvɛi_3217_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>amulette</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>amulet</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.8 Religious things"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>protective amulet; cowry</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 1 occurrences, first JOS.10.13; Keita 1979, p. 150: Sèvèi; Childs 2000, p. 329: sɛ́wɛ̀í</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Sens confirmé par Childs. Le seul sɛvɛi de la Bible (Jos 10,13) est une forme de sɛva « écrire ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛwviaa_3218">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛwviaa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛwviaan</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛwviallo</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛwviaa_3218_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>écrire (plusieurs choses), rédiger (des lettres) ; (sɛwviallo) écrire à qqn</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>write (several things), write letters; (sɛwviallo) write to someone</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.7 Reading and writing"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>write (plural)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 6 occurrences, first JOS.18.9; Childs 2000, p. 327: sɛ̀ɛ̀wìá</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Pluriel de sɛvaa « écrire ». Yesabɛl sɛwviaa sɛbɛlan « Jézabel écrivit des lettres » (1KI.21.8) ; sɛbɛlan sɛwviallo « s'écrire des lettres » (NEH.6.17).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛ́wɔ̀ɔ́_3219">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛ́wɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <sense id="sɛ́wɔ̀ɔ́_3219_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>médecine de sorcellerie</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>witchcraft medicine</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.4 Miracle, supernatural power"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 329: sɛ́wɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛyanndo_3220">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛyanndo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sɛyanndo_3220_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>se séparer, se quitter ; distinguer (entre)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>part, separate (from each other); distinguish (between)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.2.3 Move toward something"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.2.4 Understand"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 15 occurrences, first DEU.1.39</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Dérivé de sɛi « séparer » ; sina sɛyanndo dɛnɛ kɛndɔɔ a dɛnɛ vɔɔndo tɛɛn « distinguer le bien du mal » (Dt 1,39).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛŋi_3221">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛŋi</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛŋin</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛŋi_3221_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>disperser, répandre ; (sɛŋin) se répandre</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>scatter, spread; (sɛŋin) spread out</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.3.2 Move something in a direction"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 39 occurrences, first GEN.11.8</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛ̀ŋìá_3222">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛ̀ŋìá</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <sense id="sɛ̀ŋìá_3222_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>nier, désavouer ; contredire</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>deny, repudiate; argue</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="3.5.1 Say"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 328: sɛ̀ŋìá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
