    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>citizen, human being</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 479 occurrences, first GEN.1.26; Childs 2000, p. 379: wànà-cíóó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Po vanacieo « le Fils de l'homme ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
