      <gloss lang="en"><text>net</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.4.5 Fishing"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.4.2 Trap"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>round scoop net used by women for fishing; mosquito net</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 106 occurrences, first GEN.49.9; Keita 1979, p. 160: Yalaa; Childs 2000, p. 396: yàlàá</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>La Bible l'écrit sans tons ; à distinguer de yàlàá « lion ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
