    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>break into small pieces</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 26 occurrences, first NUM.24.8; Childs 2000, p. 408: yìmìó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>yimiyimi « briser en morceaux » (Lv 2,6).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
